      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In the meantime, it is possible to add security authorization to an avatar. Just add a collider, fixed joint it to nothing so that it points to the world's 0,0,0 instead, and offset it by some random huge numbers like 40k, 34k, 56k. Then have a collider in the world at that same position and onentertrigger playerlocal, give you access to something. Surprisingly enough, you don't even need to wear the avatar, which would have the possibility of it being stolen. Somehow this will trigger when you add the avatar to your favorites list, so you never need to worry about someone stealing it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
